      "returnType": "FPBDCollisionConstraint",
      "docs": "@brief Return a constraint copied from the Source constraint, for use in the Resim Cache or other system\n@note Unlike the other factory method, this version returns a constraint by value for emplacing into an array (ther others are by pointer)"
    },
