      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Restore the properties of a collision from the properties of another. Used by the rewind/resim system when restoring\na collision constraint that was saved (and called MakeCopy).\nThis takes care not to overwrite any data maintained for the use of other systems (the ContainerCookie, Graph data, etc)"
